    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9b899cb5_41db5840",
        "filename": "util/focaltech/updater.cc",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 19,
      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-01T20:57:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Google C++ Style Guide mandates that a source file\u0027s corresponding header must be the absolute first `#include`. This ensures the header is entirely self-contained and does not silently rely on dependencies implicitly provided by other headers.\n* **Fix:** Move `#include \"updater.h\"` to the top of the include block in `updater.cc`:\n\n\n```cpp\n#include \"updater.h\"\n\n#include \u003calgorithm\u003e\n#include \u003ccstdint\u003e\n// ... remaining standard headers\n\n#include \u003copenssl/sha.h\u003e\n\n// ... remaining project headers\n\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 19,
        "endChar": 23
      },
      "revId": "b3583f3628496f9c614211af85ac648cbc8fa1e4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8bd5edc1_3eeeb2cb",
        "filename": "util/focaltech/updater.cc",
        "patchSetId": 17
      },
      "lineNbr": 267,
